  "infoKegelTitle": "What is a Kegel exercise?",
  "infoKegelBody": "Squeezing and lifting your pelvic floor muscles, the ones you use to stop passing wind, then letting them go fully. It needs no equipment and nobody can see you doing it.",
  "infoRemindersTitle": "About reminders",
